---
import ThemeImage from './ThemeImage.astro';
import SocialLinks from './SocialLinks.astro';
import SchoolLink from './SchoolLink.astro';
import ContinuationArrow from './ContinuationArrow.astro';
---
<section id="about-me" class="hero site-width" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <h1 id="hero-title" class="sr-only">Guozheng Ma</h1>
    <div class="hero-bio">
      <p>I’m Guozheng Ma, a PhD student at <SchoolLink school="ntu" />, advised by <a href="https://dr.ntu.edu.sg/cris/rp/rp02343">Dacheng Tao</a>. Previously, I completed my master’s studies at <SchoolLink school="thu" /> and my bachelor’s degree at <SchoolLink school="hnu" />.</p>
      <p>My research focuses on deep reinforcement learning: how agents can learn efficiently, scale, and keep adapting in open-ended environments. I study optimization, network sparsity, plasticity, and the interplay between offline knowledge and online experience. More broadly, I’m interested in RL as a way to understand and develop intelligence.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <SocialLinks />
      <a href="/about/" class="continuation-link"><span>More About Me</span><ContinuationArrow /></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-portrait">
    <ThemeImage src="/art/portrait.webp" alt="An illustrated portrait of Guozheng Ma" width="600" height="600" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
  </div>
</section>
<p class="personal-motto site-width">Greatness cannot be planned, so I play with joyful explorations!</p>
